BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country
UID:event_316472611@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045604Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T120000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® at Aqus in Petaluma (in person)
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\n**Coworking for writers in Pe
 taluma!**\nJoin us for some focused writing time. All experience levels ar
 e welcome\, and don’t worry\, no one will see what you've written. This 
 session is about getting some writing done\, whether you're working on a n
 ovel\, memoir\, short story\, dissertation\, job application\, blog\, poet
 ry\, a song or just want to journal.\n\n**Format**\n10:30 - 10:45am: Intro
 duce yourself and what you're working on today\n10:45 - 11:45am: Write in 
 silence for 1 hour\n11:45am - 12pm: Check in with one another and exchange
  how it went\n\n**Venue Details:**\n\n* Aqus has WiFi for guests\n* Ample 
 street parking is available\n* Please thank our hosts by purchasing someth
 ing\n* If music or ambient noise are distracting\, please bring ear plugs 
 or headphones\n* There are a few outlets available if you need to charge y
 our device
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/3164
 72611/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260908T180209Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T180209Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country
UID:event_316315667@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045604Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T120000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® at Redwood Café in Cotati (in person)
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\n**Coworking for writers in Co
 tati!**\nJoin us for some focused writing time. All experience levels are 
 welcome\, and don’t worry\, no one will see what you've written. This se
 ssion is about WRITING\, whether you're working on a novel\, memoir\, play
 \, short story\, dissertation\, job application\, blog\, poetry\, journal\
 , or song.\n\n**Format**\n10:00 - 10:15 AM: Introduce yourself and what yo
 u're working on today\n10:15 - 11:30 AM: Write in silence for 1 hour and 1
 5 minutes.\n11:30 - 11:45 AM: Check in with one another and share how it w
 ent\n\n**Venue Details:**\n\n* Redwood Cafe has WiFi for guests\n* Ample s
 treet parking is available\n* Please thank our hosts by purchasing somethi
 ng\n* If music or ambient noise are distracting\, please bring ear plugs o
 r headphones\n* Outlets are available if you need to charge your laptop
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/3163
 15667/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260828T181313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260828T181313Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country
UID:event_316532320@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045604Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T163000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!™ Santa Rosa REMOTE ZOOM FRIDAY 
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\n**This event is hosted on the
  Shut Up & Write website\, so please [sign up here](https://www.shutupwrit
 e.com/series/id2me5JeN600/id2w10OBEA00) for your writing event.**\n\n**ABO
 UT THE EVENT**\nJoin us virtually for an hour + of writing using Zoom. Let
 's keep together as much as we can during these uncertain times and keep o
 n writing. Look for the schedule online and join us.\n\nWe’ve discovered
  that it’s strikingly helpful to write with other writers. See if it’s
  true for you at 3pm on Friday afternoon. Be it a book\, blog\, script\, e
 ssay\, dissertation\, resume\, melody\, poem or just plain work stuff\, yo
 u are invited to write it with us. No one will see what you've written or 
 give you unsolicited advice. Instead of just thinking about writing\, come
  and get some real writing done.\n\nJOIN US!\n\n1. Link available on the S
 hut Up and Write website..\n\nPlease note:\n\n1. If you don't have Zoom se
 t up on your computer yet\, leave 15-30 minutes ahead of time to get it se
 t up!\n2. If you have difficulty with audio (don't have a microphone set u
 p)\, as long as you have a speaker\, you can call in (you'll see phone num
 bers when you log in).\n3. If you are late\, you won't be able to intro wi
 th us\, but you are still welcome to join in.\n4. If you won't be able to 
 make it\, please cancel so that the space is available to another writer.\
 n\nSCHEDULE:\n3:00 - quick intros.\naround 3:10 - timer starts: write for 
 70 mins.\n4:20 - (the end) wrap up\n\nWherever you are\, we hope to see yo
 u online! Keep on writing...\nRegards\,\nLorraine Segal
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/3165
 32320/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260912T221236Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260912T221236Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
